# Quartus on Windows rewrites these three files with CRLF on every compile.
# Pinning them to LF makes the rewrite invisible to git (MacLC's practice).
# Nothing else is pinned on purpose: an inherited file keeps the line endings
# it came with, and a broad pattern would renormalise those blobs into
# whole-file diffs (SE30_PLAN.md 3.1).
/MacSE30.qpf text eol=lf
/MacSE30.qsf text eol=lf
/MacSE30.sdc text eol=lf
